A cyberpunk-style digital illustration of a glowing cryptographic key floating in mid-air, its intricate geometric teeth made of pulsing neon circuitry in electric blue and magenta. The key hovers above an outstretched mechanical hand with exposed wiring and chrome fingers. Behind it, streams of encrypted data flow like rain through a dark cityscape of towering server monoliths, their surfaces covered in holographic authentication seals and digital fingerprint patterns. The atmosphere is moody with deep purple shadows and harsh cyan highlights, rain droplets catching the glow of distant neon signs. Visible chains of glowing hexagonal links connect the key to multiple floating code repositories represented as luminous cubes in the background, suggesting verified trust and secure connections across a vast digital network.
